{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56402","headline":"北京内晏 · 贺兰遂","name":"北京内晏","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"镜鸣桂殿千山晓，花发梨园百卉新。\n（《千载佳句》卷下《宫省部·禁中》。\n）（按：《全唐诗逸》卷中收贺兰暹诗，注「一作遂」。\n今检《千载佳句》作贺兰遂，《日本国见在书目》有「《贺兰遂集》二〖卷〗。\n」当以作遂爲是。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贺兰遂","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56402.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56402","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}